      "value": "We have identified this issue, and the good news is this only occurs between live and open-beta users. A fix would be complicated from the technical side, and we don't expect this beta to go on for too much longer, so we have decided to simply leave this one be. Apologies for one or two more weekends with slightly broken physbone posing, once 2024.3.2 ships to live this will resolve itself!",
